 * SPI interface (CE0 / GPIO8, mode 0, 1 MHz)
 * Logs timestamp + distance (mm) to distance_log.csv every 100 ms.
 *
 * Build:  gcc -O2 -Wall -o icu20201_log icu20201_log.c -lpigpio -lrt
 * Run:    sudo ./icu20201_log
