/*
 * LSM303DLHC magnetometer reader with PWM LED output.
 *
 * Board:  Raspberry Pi Zero W
 * I2C:    /dev/i2c-1 (physical SDA1/SCL1)
 * Sensor: LSM303DLHC magnetometer (I2C address 0x1E)
 * LED:    GPIO17 (BCM) with hardware PWM
