/*
 * PIR-triggered door strike controller for Raspberry Pi 4 Model B.
 *
 * Hardware:
 *   - HC-SR501 PIR sensor  -> physical GPIO4  (BCM 4)
 *   - Door strike relay    -> physical GPIO17 (BCM 17)
 *
 * Behavior:
 *   Polls the PIR every 50 ms.  On a rising edge (motion detected) the
 *   relay is energized for 1 s, then de-energized.  If the PIR stays
 *   HIGH for > 10 s a failsafe is triggered: the relay is de-energized,
 *   a warning is logged, and a shutdown event is recorded.
